1
00:00:00,201 --> 00:00:01,511
(Raj:)Well, I guess it goes back to

2
00:00:01,669 --> 00:00:03,879
(Raj:)when I was a fat kid in India,
and didn't have any friends.

3
00:00:04,038 --> 00:00:05,378
(Bernadette:)I didn't know you were fat.

4
00:00:05,540 --> 00:00:09,820
Yeah, I was 200 pounds
by the time I was in middle school.

5
00:00:09,977 --> 00:00:12,387
(Raj:)Kids were mean.
Cows may be sacred there,

6
00:00:12,547 --> 00:00:14,547
(Raj:)but it doesn't help
if you look like one.

7
00:00:15,883 --> 00:00:17,293
(Raj:)Anyway, I was pretty lonely,

8
00:00:17,451 --> 00:00:19,521
(Raj:)so I had to make up
my own stories and games,

9
00:00:19,687 --> 00:00:21,827
(Raj:)and I promised myself
if I ever made any friends

10
00:00:21,989 --> 00:00:24,799
(Raj:)that I would play
those games with them.

11
00:00:25,293 --> 00:00:26,863
(Amy:)That is so sweet.

12
00:00:27,562 --> 00:00:29,202
(Leonard:)I've seen old pictures of you.

13
00:00:29,363 --> 00:00:30,633
(Leonard:)You were never a fat kid.

14
00:00:30,798 --> 00:00:32,708
(Raj:)No, I was svelte as a gazelle.

15
00:00:34,468 --> 00:00:37,508
(Raj:)A gazelle blessed with a flair
for storytelling.

16
00:00:37,572 --> 00:00:39,522
I (DRAMATIC MUSIC PLAYS)

17
00:00:41,676 --> 00:00:43,716
(Bernadette:)Hey, what about this?
It locks like a receipt.

18
00:00:43,878 --> 00:00:45,518
(Amy:)-What's it for?
-For a cup of coffee.

19
00:00:45,680 --> 00:00:47,520
(Bernadette:)But it's dated 20 years from now.

20
00:00:47,682 --> 00:00:51,392
(Raj:)From the future?
How fun and imaginative.

21
00:00:53,254 --> 00:00:56,234
(Leonard:)So one of us came back from
the future to murder Stuart?

22
00:00:56,390 --> 00:00:57,390
(Raj:)Correct.

23
00:00:57,558 --> 00:00:59,438
(Leonard:)Does the gazelle with a flair
for storytelling

24
00:00:59,594 --> 00:01:01,264
know he's ripping off Terminator?

